    {
      "Original": "Advanced: override which timelines actively play, independent of State.\nLeave at default (0) unless you need to combine multiple independent effects on this slot (e.g. torches + gate) or trigger a transition bit that isn't a resting State value.",
      "Context": "EditorWindow.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGuiEx.Tooltip",
      "Translated": "高级：单独指定要播放的时间轴，不受状态值影响。\n通常保留默认值 0。若需要在同一槽位叠加多个独立效果（如火把与大门），或触发静止状态值以外的过渡位，再更改此项。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Another entry in this phase already targets this slot. Only the last one in the list will actually apply.",
      "Context": "EditorWindow.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGuiEx.Tooltip",
      "Translated": "此阶段已有条目使用这个槽位，只有列表中最后一项会生效。",
